@startuml
title HBVM(4,2) simulation and notebook studies

package simulation {
  class HBVM42 {
    +integrate(problem, request)
  }
  class BM4Implicit {
    +coupling_frequency
    +nonlinear_solver
    +integrate(problem, request)
  }
  class "integrate_fixed_grid" as FixedGrid
  class IntegrationData
}

package dynamics {
  interface DynamicalSystem
  interface HamiltonianSystem
  interface GuidingCenterJacobianSystem
  class GuidingCenterDynamics
}

package studies {
  class HBVM42EvaluationConfig
  class HBVM42EvaluationResult
  class HBVM42BM4ComparisonConfig
  class HBVM42BM4ComparisonResult
  class QuarticOscillatorDynamics
  class "run_hbvm42_evaluation" as IndividualStudy
  class "run_hbvm42_bm4_comparison" as ComparisonStudy
}

package visualization {
  class "plot_hbvm42_evaluation" as IndividualPlot
  class "plot_hbvm42_energy_errors" as EnergyPlot
  class "plot_hbvm42_bm4_comparison" as ComparisonPlot
}

DynamicalSystem --> HBVM42 : vector field
HamiltonianSystem --> HBVM42 : optional energy
GuidingCenterJacobianSystem --> HBVM42 : optional exact Jacobians
HBVM42 --> FixedGrid
GuidingCenterDynamics --> BM4Implicit : physical GC problem
GuidingCenterJacobianSystem --> BM4Implicit : analytic stage Jacobians
BM4Implicit --> FixedGrid
FixedGrid --> IntegrationData

QuarticOscillatorDynamics ..|> DynamicalSystem
QuarticOscillatorDynamics ..|> HamiltonianSystem
QuarticOscillatorDynamics ..|> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem
GuidingCenterDynamics ..|> DynamicalSystem
GuidingCenterDynamics ..|> HamiltonianSystem
GuidingCenterDynamics ..|> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem

HBVM42EvaluationConfig --> IndividualStudy
QuarticOscillatorDynamics --> IndividualStudy
IndividualStudy --> HBVM42EvaluationResult
HBVM42EvaluationResult --> IndividualPlot
HBVM42EvaluationResult --> EnergyPlot

HBVM42BM4ComparisonConfig --> ComparisonStudy
GuidingCenterDynamics --> ComparisonStudy
ComparisonStudy ..> HBVM42 : compares
ComparisonStudy ..> BM4Implicit : compares
ComparisonStudy --> HBVM42BM4ComparisonResult
HBVM42BM4ComparisonResult --> ComparisonPlot

note right of HBVM42
  4 quadrature stages
  2 Legendre unknowns
  order 4
end note

note right of BM4Implicit
  physical accepted state only
  12-stage BM4 cycle
  one reduced Hairer projection
  around the complete cycle
end note
@enduml
